---
title: Lock Status of a Sell Offer (derived from the latest lock record)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NoLock: Offer published

    NoLock --> Active: Insert wins, version 0
    Active --> Released: release(version) sets released_on
    Active --> Expired: Database time reaches expiration
    Expired --> Released: Recovery learns the outcome, then release

    Released --> Active: Insert wins, version + 1

    Released --> [*]: Offer status is Executed, Withdrawn or Expired

    note right of NoLock
        No record exists.
        Current version is -1.
        Offer is Available.
    end note

    note right of Active
        released_on is empty and
        expiration is in the future.
        Offer is Locked_For_Pre_Processing
        or Locked_For_Processing by phase.
        Other attempts get ALREADY_LOCKED
        with nextRetryTime = expiration.
    end note

    note right of Expired
        Derived from the clock, nothing is written.
        Still unreleased, so still locked and
        not re-acquirable. Recovery asks Transaction
        for the outcome first.
    end note

    note left of Released
        The only update ever made to a lock
        record is the one-time write of released_on.
        Offer is Available again.
    end note